The CustomResourceDefinitions under rabbitmq-crds/templates/ are vendored verbatim from the
upstream RabbitMQ Kubernetes operators:

  - rabbitmq/cluster-operator              (rabbitmqclusters.rabbitmq.com)
  - rabbitmq/messaging-topology-operator   (all other rabbitmq.com CRDs)

Both projects are licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0. The CRD documents are
unmodified; only their packaging (splitting them into a standalone Helm chart) is this
repository's work.

